---
import { BRAND } from '../lib/brand';
import HelloFraandsPage from '../layouts/HelloFraandsPage.astro';
---
<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-19" title="Age policy" summary="Callers aur influencers, sabhi ka 18 saal ya usse zyada hona zaroori hai." review={false} related={[]}>
<h2>Adults only</h2>
<p>You must be at least 18 to call, or to be an influencer, on {BRAND.name}. An adult must not let a child use their account.</p>
<h2>How age is checked</h2>
<p>Everyone declares their age at sign-up. Do not use another person's details.</p>
<h2>If we find a minor</h2>
<p>We close the account. Its remaining wallet balance can be withdrawn with the Payout button after the usual ID and UPI checks. We may ask for information needed to verify the account and process that payout safely.</p>
<p>If you believe a user is under 18, <a href="/report">report the profile or call</a>. Do not ask them to send you identity documents. See our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for how your data is handled.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
